  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Syed Althaf, vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 9 November, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.5005 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "A case under Sections 328, 272 and 273 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 and under Section 59(i) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 was registered against the petitioners. The said case is now under investigation.",
    "arguments": "4. Both the learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Additional Public Prosecutor would submit that this is a covered matter and earlier this Court [LEAKAGE_MASK] the F.I.R. registered for the similar offences based on identical facts. Therefore, learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that the petitioners, who are similarly placed, are also entitled for the relief of quash of F.I.R. 5.",
